<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Templeton raises stake in Email.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Templeton raises stake in Email.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Templeton Worldwide Inc has increased its stake in Australian appliance and building products group Email Ltd to 9.01 percent from 7.67 percent previously, an Australian Stock Exchange statement said.</p>
<p>Templeton said in a substantial shareholder notice to the exchange on Wednesday that it now held 26.21 million Email shares, compared with 22.30 million previously.</p>
<p>At 2.00 p.m. (0400 GMT), Email shares were 11 cents lower at A$3.50.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
